# Gems rbenv-default-gems installs into every Ruby that `rbenv install` builds.
#
# Both run under each project's own Ruby (the rbenv shim picks it from .ruby-version), so
# they have to exist in every version: Claude Code's ruby-lsp plugin and Neovim's ruby_lsp
# and rubocop servers fail in a project whose Ruby lacks them.
dotenvcrypt
ruby-lsp
rubocop
